# The am-ci-guard fixtures are verbatim copies of other repositories'
# ci.yml and .github-guard, and its tests mutate them by matching exact
# text containing `\n`. This repository's CI runs that suite on
# windows-latest, where a CRLF checkout would stop every mutation
# matching. Pin them to LF so the fixture a test reads is the fixture
# that was committed, on every runner.
crates/am-ci-guard/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
